.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
data/*.sqlite
data/*.db
data/*.parquet
data/raw/
data/logs/

# Pre-built holdings snapshot IS committed, unlike the other data/*.db
# files (market.db price/ticker cache, seen_filings.db alert state) --
# 82 investors x 8 quarters takes long enough to fetch cold that a fresh
# Render/Streamlit Cloud deploy risks hitting the platform's request
# timeout via the in-app "fetch now" button. Shipping a working snapshot
# means the site is usable immediately; the sidebar button still refreshes
# it live whenever that's wanted.
!data/holdings.db
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
